# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Geocoding API)
#
# Quickstart — Get a free, zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key.
# 5. Copy the key below and save this file as `.env.local` in this directory.
#
# For production deployments:
# - Create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Geocoding API
# - Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and limit to only the required APIs:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
